WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.783
The evaluation is broad.

00:00:01.863 --> 00:00:08.227
For graph classification, six datasets: MUTAG,
PROTEINS, NCI1, COLLAB, IMDB-Binary,

00:00:08.307 --> 00:00:11.953
and IMDB-Multi, under ten-fold cross-validation.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:18.396
For node classification, six heterophilic
benchmarks: Chameleon, Squirrel, Cornell,

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:20.570
Texas, Wisconsin, and Actor.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:26.548
To rule out leakage they test filtered Chameleon
and Squirrel, and for scale,

00:00:26.628 --> 00:00:32.370
mini-batch experiments on three graphs with
hundreds of thousands of nodes.
